OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Toys R Us store demolition
OL,4,Agets under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemolition work has started on the
OL,7,Fformer Toys R Us store in Southampton.
OL,9,FThe 4.6-acre site on Harbour Parade,
OL,10,Fclose to the Central railway station,
OL,11,Fhas been derelict since Toys R Us
OL,12,Fcollapsed in 2018, apart from being
OL,13,Fused temporarily to store donations for
OL,14,FUkraine in 2022.
OL,16,FThe partial demolition is expected to
OL,17,Ftake eight weeks, with the roof and
OL,18,Fsides being left in place for
OL,19,Fshort-term temporary uses - the city
OL,20,Fcouncil said possible ideas being
OL,21,Fexplored included a padel court, event
OL,22,Fspace and market.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
