OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Toys R Us store demolition
OL,4,Agets under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FAviva Capital Partners, Southampton
OL,7,FCity Council and the University of
OL,8,FSouthampton have teamed up to take on
OL,9,Fthe site and plan to redevelop it into
OL,10,Fa mixed-use area with offices and
OL,11,Fhomes.
